<p>I'm sorry to say, but this feels really incomplete. Whatever intrigue that the article brings me remains unanswered throughout to the end and quite honestly this feels like it's written by someone who doesn't understand or bothered attempting to elaborate on why being able to hack into outright anything is anomalous, or even interesting. The name drop to UIU had a reverse impact on me; instead of making me feel &quot;wow, they could do that?&quot; it made me go &quot;there's no way this makes sense&quot;.</p>
<p>I think this suffers a case of show-don't-tell in that I'm being told how outrageous the situation is but nothing that pulls its weight and make it feel grand, rather that it's odd being delivered this way. I think the places in the article like the breach and the high cooperation level as shown could be translated into logs that are interesting to read and experience, but in its current form it really feels lacking.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<p><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/fluffydog00" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2075210); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2075210&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607194773" alt="FluffyDog00" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2075210)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/fluffydog00" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2075210); return false;">FluffyDog00</a></span></p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;show&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">–&nbsp;hide&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>In order for an article to work, there needs to be a strong narrative with a clear beginning, middle, and end. This has a beginning and a middle. There are no stakes, just a dude who is really good at something, and has no further character development other than that. It's boring and tasteless.</p>
<p>-1</p>
</div>
</div>
