<p><strong>Seeking Greenlights:</strong> Yes<br />
<strong>Page Type:</strong> SCP Article<br />
<strong>Genre (Optional):</strong> Horror<br />
<strong>Page Layout (Optional):</strong> Standard SCP Article</p>
<p><strong>Elevator Pitch:</strong> SCP-XXXX commonly called (Midnight sun) is a:<br />
⦁ Large 45&#160;m dark quadrupedal aquatic life form<br />
⦁ Similar in appearance to the prehistoric lizard known as mosasaurs<br />
⦁ Has a Tentacle mane around the back of cranium<br />
⦁ Travels at speeds equal or in access of 400km/h<br />
⦁ Strength to body to ratio is 20:1<br />
⦁ Covered in Robust Black scale armour exterior<br />
⦁ It Can only viewed at night<br />
⦁ Avoid direct eye contact, avoid viewing for more than 1 minute continuously<br />
⦁ It's origins remain unknown<br />
⦁ Was on the move until it was contained at the <strong>THE RING</strong><br />
⦁ Can increase area of influence</p>
<p><strong>Central Narrative:</strong><br />
SCP was first alerted to the foundation through an agent located in NOAA(National Oceanic and Atmospheric Administration), NOAA noticed a drastic change in salinity in area 1km2 somewhere in the Atlantic. Initial expedition failed resulting in the loss of all life. Data emitted during time of expedition discovered: salinity in the water had changed and that the underwater local flora/fauna had mutated and become highly aggressive, SCP causing this was found to be also extremely aggressive and intelligent. SCP was contained at the site known as the <strong>THE RING</strong> after 3 failed expedition and considerable loss of life. Containment was achieved with the aide of new countermeasure technology such as: PUVDS ( perimeter ultra violet defence system- a defence systems which emits a strong ultra violet light deep into the water)- pinning SCP into a confined area, SPS( Sea perimeter system- a system designed to prevent the influence of SCP-XXXX from exceeding a 20km2 zone and for the salinity of water to not change outside of the zone. Loss of life was deemed acceptable to contain SCP-XXXX given its aggressiveness and intelligence and usual parameters of containment failing. SCP-XXXX full name is Leviathan der Mitternachtsonne (Leviathan of the Midnight sun) and was named by a formerly deceased Kreigsmarine U-boat/K version captain.</p>
<p><strong>Hook/Attention-Grabber:</strong> SCP most dangerous ability is that it is capable of salinity conversion, which if left uncheck can cause cataclysmic change in weather, flora/fauna, disrupt oxygen levels. SCP-XXXX is also capable Phycological Physical Mutation (Able to transform a victim using their brain to mutate their body, without the need of physical contact provided certain conditions are met) creating 5 sub entities of various forms like the Gespenst(wraith). It uses this ability to great effect in order to escape its confinement.</p>
<p><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Constructive criticism is greatly appreciated.👍</p>

